## 4. Output Contract: `docs/architecture.md` (or `docs/features/<feature-slug>/architecture.md`)

Compile the architecture specification using this exact schema:

```markdown
# Architecture Blueprint: {{projectName}}
<!-- Scope: Whole Repository | Feature Slice: <Feature Name> -->

## 1. High-Level Architectural Pattern
- **Pattern:** <e.g., Clean Architecture / ASP.NET Identity Pipeline / Fastify API>
- **Target Feature (if scoped):** <e.g., IdentityServer Login & MFA Lifecycle>
- **State & Session Strategy:** <e.g., Encrypted cookie authentication with Redis token store>

## 2. Component & Feature Slice Topology
\`\`\`mermaid
graph TD
    subgraph Ingress ["Ingress Tier"]
        Client["Client / Browser"]
        AccountCtrl["Account Controller\n(Quickstart/Account/AccountController.cs)"]
    end

    subgraph CoreServices ["Authentication & Domain Core"]
        SignInMgr["Sign-In Manager / AuthService"]
        PasswordHasher["Password Hasher (Argon2 / PBKDF2)"]
        TokenSvc["Token & Claims Service"]
    end

    subgraph DataStorage ["Persistence & Cache"]
        UserDB[("User & Credential Store\n(PostgreSQL / SQL Server)")]
        SessionCache[("Redis Session & Token Store")]
    end

    subgraph External ["External Providers"]
        SmsGateway["Twilio SMS Gateway (MFA)"]
    end

    Client --> AccountCtrl
    AccountCtrl --> SignInMgr
    SignInMgr --> UserDB
    SignInMgr --> PasswordHasher
    SignInMgr --> TokenSvc
    SignInMgr --> SessionCache
    SignInMgr -. "MFA Challenge" .-> SmsGateway
\`\`\`

## 3. End-to-End Sequence Diagram (Feature Lifecycle)
### Feature Flow: <e.g., Complete Login & MFA Challenge Lifecycle>
\`\`\`mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Client
    participant Ctrl as AccountController
    participant Svc as SignInManager
    participant DB as UserStore / DB
    participant Hash as PasswordHasher
    participant MFA as MfaService
    participant Token as TokenService

    User->>Ctrl: POST /account/login (username, password, rememberMe)
    Ctrl->>Svc: PasswordSignInAsync(username, password)
    Svc->>DB: FindByNameAsync(username)
    DB-->>Svc: UserRecord (Salt, Hash, IsLocked, MfaEnabled)
    
    alt Account is Locked
        Svc-->>Ctrl: SignInResult.LockedOut
        Ctrl-->>User: 423 Locked (Account locked due to 5 failed attempts)
    else Credentials Valid & MFA Required
        Svc->>Hash: VerifyHashedPassword(password, storedHash)
        Hash-->>Svc: Success
        Svc->>MFA: GenerateChallengeAsync(user.Id)
        MFA-->>Svc: MfaChallengeToken
        Svc-->>Ctrl: SignInResult.RequiresTwoFactor
        Ctrl-->>User: 200 OK { requiresMfa: true, challengeToken: "..." }
    else Credentials Valid & No MFA
        Svc->>Token: CreateUserPrincipalAsync(user)
        Token-->>Svc: ClaimsPrincipal
        Svc-->>Ctrl: SignInResult.Success (AuthCookie)
        Ctrl-->>User: 200 OK (Set-Cookie: .AspNetCore.Identity.Application)
    end
\`\`\`

