## 5. Architectural Fitness & Layer Boundary Evaluation
- **Isolation Assessment:** Does the feature cleanly separate UI/route logic from cryptographic and persistence code?
- **Layer Violations:** <e.g., Raw SQL queries executed in `AccountController.cs#L140` instead of delegating to `IUserStore`.>
- **Reconstruction Readiness:** Can this feature be extracted as an independent microservice or modular package?
